# {{ design_vlnv }} SystemC AT skeleton

This deterministic project contains structural SystemC modules and TLM 2.0
two-phase AT socket bindings generated from the selected Spec design. It has no
traffic, functional behavior, performance queues, or waveform tracing.

## Build

Install SystemC 2.3.3, then point CMake at its installation prefix:

```bash
cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/path/to/systemc-dist
cmake --build build
```

## Run

```bash
./build/{{ project }}_systemc_at
```

The empty simulation runs for 10 cycles at 10 ns per cycle.
